        "title": "Reading the reference values",
        "text": [
          "The rating multiplier changes a species’ displayed rarity rating. The relative selection weight describes the mutation’s base place in the selection pool, before your active mutation-rarity adjustments. It is not a percentage, and it is not the complete per-roll chance. Natural mutations have an initial chance stage before a named variant is selected.",
          "The gallery includes disabled Christmas definitions for identification. An artwork file or a listed name does not by itself make a mutation currently obtainable. Summer and Halloween mutations are enabled in this version; those flags are separate from the seasonal Cosmetic Crate controls on the main site."
        ]
