      {
        "title": "Collecting around an event",
        "text": [
          "Search by the exact mutation name in your collection and clear unrelated filters before checking whether you own it. One species can contribute separate Summer and Halloween entries when rolled on different occasions, but one catch still has a maximum of one mutation.",
          "Existing collection records and their first-find progress are distinct from whether a variant can currently be selected on a fresh roll. Keep both ideas separate when comparing a historical collection with the active pool."
        ]
      }
